concepts.content:
The intrinsic camera parameters (using perspective projection) are:
$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathbf{M}
= 
\begin{bmatrix}
a & 0 & n_0\\
0 & a & m_0 \\ 
0 & 0 & 1 
\end{bmatrix}.
\end{aligned}
$$

